— Em que os autores insistem?","**Give it your all.** — Dar tudo de si."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"analyze","pt":"analisar","forms":[["I / you / we / they analyze","We analyze the data."],["he / she / it analyses","Analisamos os dados."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Study talk","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Study talk","lines":[["Ana","What does the study analyze?","O que o estudo analisa?"],["Leo","How inflation affects wages in six countries.","Como a inflação afeta salários em seis países."],["Ana","What do the authors insist on?","Em que os autores insistem?"],["Leo","Indexing wages to inflation.","Indexar salários à inflação."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Entonação de contraste, surpresa, dúvida","items":[{"label":"Entonação de contraste, surpresa, dúvida","note":"Pratique em voz alta.","words":[]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Summarize a study.","pt":"Resuma.","model":"This study analyses wages."},{"q":"Use should as inversion.","pt":"Use.","model":"Should inflation continue, savings could shrink."},{"q":"Make a recommendation.","pt":"Recomende.","model":"The authors insist on reform."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 6-line summary of an economic study.","model":"This study analyses how inflation affects wages in six countries. It is clear that wages have lagged behind prices since 2020. If governments had raised minimum wages earlier, workers would be better protected today. The authors object to delaying reforms. They insist on indexing wages to inflation. Should inflation continue, savings could lose value.","checklist":["Usei **It is clear that**","Usei **condicional misto**","Resumo acadêmico"],"words":"6 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":